		{"id":"57c15876300cd1d8","x":260,"y":-360,"width":414,"height":608,"type":"text","text":"Customer loses money due to:\n\n- forgotten subscriptions\n- unexpected price increases\n- potential fraudulent transactions\n\nidentifying these issues manually across hundreds of transactions is difficult, leaves unnecessary costs and suspicious activity unnoticed.\n\nOur Challenge:\n\nBuild a solution on Databricks that analyzes customer transactions to detect:\n\n- recurring payments\n- unused subscriptions\n- potentially fraudulent activity\n\nThe solution should explain & prioritize findings based on *financial impact* and *present clear, actionable recommendations* to help customer save money and protect their finances.\n"}
